  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container container--wide">
      <p class="eyebrow">Open-weight models for bimanual robotic manipulation and efficient adaptation</p>
      <h1>Rho</h1>
      <p class="hero__title-expansion">Robotic Manipulation Models With Adaptation In Mind</p>
      <p class="hero__dek">
        Rho is a family of open-weight, 5B-parameter physical AI models that
        combines a physically grounded Phi-family vision-language backbone with a
        continuous flow-matching action expert. Its regularized progressive
        adaptation recipe moves from physical grounding, to multi-embodiment
        pretraining, to embodiment-targeted horizontal midtraining, and finally to
        vertical task adaptation.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__links">
        {resources.map((resource) => (
          <a class="button" href={resource.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            {resource.label}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
